Z||000003||Richard Parnell||05-03-2001||03:14 PM||||I too did the slave, master and even new clutch and throwout change only to find that the clutch release lever was bent.  I got a replacement from the local Pontiac dealer.  It's not pressed metal like the one that bent.  It's cast and will not bend.  You are being misinformed by your GM dealer.||||reg||1
Z||000004||RiceCooker||05-03-2001||04:15 PM||||Maybe i will check with GM again - could be some guy workin there that day who didn't feel like dealing with an ancient part.<P>I figured i WAS choosing the right vendor and not some backyard or whole in the wall operation. Right now i'm regretting that i didnt just get it from some guys back yard.||||reg||1
