Z||000014||RiceCooker||05-07-2001||05:43 PM||||Hey Fierodave, thanks for the pic.<P>It's #1 in the diagram although that may seem obvious to most. I know only one other person who actually had this part fail. <P>Yeah, sadly enough i had to get angry to have this resolved. I take pride in being very patient and undestanding but it makes me wonder, would i have had this part 2 weeks earlier if i had gotten mad then?<BR>The part came in today and its being installed (hopefully today) so i should have my car tomorrow at the latest. I forget what it looks like. <BR>I have to keep going here to remind myself that i have a car: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004312.html" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004312.html</A> <P>Yeah, Voytek and I are gonna have to take a road trip to California one of these days and bust a cap. Word up y'all.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>I will not be going through this particular vendor again, obviously. I don't like publicly bashing anyone so if you would like to know who is a the bottom of my customer satisfaction list, drop me an email. <P>Off to see Placebo tonight at the Palace  and have lots of fun so take care.<P>Todd<P>------------------<BR>This is my witty signature,<BR>It makes me cool||||reg||1
Z||000015||RiceCooker||05-08-2001||01:44 PM||||Well, to my suprise I have received several emails on the subject. Nice to know that people care about customer satisfaction these days.<P>The concert last night was wicked so i'm in a bit of a recovery mode today. ||||reg||1
